+tresc_en: |-
+  The next, XXX Conference on the History of Mathematics will take place at the Banach Center in Będlewo on **5–8 May 2016**. The conference is devoted mainly to the history of Polish mathematics, but talks on other topics are also possible, for example anniversaries related to the history of mathematics.
+
+  The conference is organised and scientifically supervised by Witold Więsław.
+
